WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.895 --> 00:00:18.935
- [Narrator] How to stay motivated.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.622
When you look at people
who are successful,

00:00:20.622 --> 00:00:22.259
you will find that they aren't the people

00:00:22.259 --> 00:00:23.330
who are motivated,

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.747
but have consistency in their motivation.

00:00:27.898 --> 00:00:30.172
Being an entrepreneur
sucks a lot of the time.

00:00:30.172 --> 00:00:31.784
It's hard to stay motivated.

00:00:31.784 --> 00:00:33.729
You might have a fantastic day,

00:00:33.729 --> 00:00:35.265
be on top of the world,

00:00:35.265 --> 00:00:36.614
and then the next morning,

00:00:36.614 --> 00:00:40.002
wake up and find you're
starting from scratch.

00:00:40.002 --> 00:00:41.331
You're doing some thing different,

00:00:41.331 --> 00:00:42.239
something new,

00:00:42.239 --> 00:00:43.451
something powerful.

00:00:43.451 --> 00:00:45.346
And it takes time to make it happen.

00:00:45.346 --> 00:00:47.477
You might have a little man in your life

00:00:47.477 --> 00:00:49.025
telling you all the reasons why

00:00:49.025 --> 00:00:51.858
you're not going to be successful.

00:00:53.115 --> 00:00:55.292
You might not be seeing
any growth or momentum

00:00:55.292 --> 00:00:57.231
as you struggle to find your way.

00:00:57.231 --> 00:00:58.792
You might even be thinking of going back

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:00.770
to get a job and do the safe thing

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:02.760
to support your family.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.951
Man, it's hard trying to stay motivated

00:01:04.951 --> 00:01:06.534
as an entrepreneur,

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:09.308
but you know what helps?

00:01:09.308 --> 00:01:11.481
Feeling like you're doing
something important.

00:01:11.481 --> 00:01:13.724
That's what people
really want out of life.

00:01:13.724 --> 00:01:17.243
That's probably what you
hated about your last job.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:18.594
You wanted to wake up and feel like

00:01:18.594 --> 00:01:21.152
the work you are doing was important.

00:01:21.152 --> 00:01:21.985
When you get that feeling,

00:01:21.985 --> 00:01:23.722
you're more likely to stay motivated,

00:01:23.722 --> 00:01:26.134
and that comes from finding your one word

00:01:26.134 --> 00:01:28.739
and applying it to make a positive impact

00:01:28.739 --> 00:01:29.906
on the world.

